#: templates/dashboard.html:1426
msgid ""
"Merit-based scholarship for OBC, EBC and DNT students in Classes 9–11. "
"Empowering the future through quality education support."
msgstr ""
"इयत्ता 9-11 मधील OBC, EBC आणि DNT विद्यार्थ्यांसाठी गुणवत्ता-आधारित शिष्यवृत्ती. "
